Cell[TextData[{
 "OK. It\[CloseCurlyQuote]s an eigenfunction, with the same eigenvalue. \n\
(One can just do ",
 StyleBox["Simplify", "Input"],
 " right away. I did it to show that it takes a calculation.)\n\n[I will add \
some material here about periodic domains, like a torus, where the basic \
example is the SL(2) Eisenstein series. If you are interested, see my \
introductory notes https://tp.hotell.kau.se/marcus/eisenstein (8 pages)]"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976613127942663*^9, 3.9766131400106363`*^9}, {
